{"title":"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> be an acute-angled scalene triangle with circumcircle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913e49ea63c6c130bb8d9d1c3556b052ecc404f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> be the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> the midpoint of minor arc <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/c/28cc93fbfb5ed16e87ce30594bc806a6094fe106.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\widehat{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"20\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913e49ea63c6c130bb8d9d1c3556b052ecc404f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"14\" />. Points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> lie of segments <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> respectively, such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/2/9a293135ae070917eb8797fb6f646726a4ec6fb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BP=BN$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/b/b4bbca6cd8ae5d8d5784309e8a9056ba43c656a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CQ=CN$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />. Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/e/dfea10d2e3c5fb78b74c2fa32425f21dcf6d9042.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K\\neq N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" /> lies on line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/a/9aafc7e3cc1eafce5e16d3a45250eeda7b1a6526.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AN$\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/6/1f6e9cbd69e0d941a61dd38e089022e9a2bea880.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MK=MN$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"99\" height=\"14\" />. Show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/1/ef1c61197c83fce364174e9a1331dd98eefdc703.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle PKQ=90^{\\circ}.\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"16\" />\n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<p>This problem needs a solution! Please help by adding one.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO\" title=\"2026 INMO\">2026 INMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2026 INMO Pr